<header>
    <h1>Eirini – 12 Week Technical Depth Programme</h1>
    <p>Strengthening hands -on capability across cloud & infrastructure.</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <!-- ABOUT ME -->
    <div class="about-card">
        <div class="about-title">About This Programme</div>
        <p class="about-text">
            My background spans network operations and people management, with hands-on experience across the platforms and practices that underpin production systems.
            This 12-week structured programme is a deliberate investment in technical depth - refreshing and extending practical skills across networking, Linux, cloud infrastructure, automation, and reliability engineering.
        </p>
        <p class="about-text">
            Each week builds on the last, with real deliverables rather than theory exercises. The programme culminates in a personal capstone project that brings together everything covered across the 12 weeks into a single end-to-end solution.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- PROGRESS -->
    <div class="progress-container">
        <div class="progress-bar">Week 10 of 12</div>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-label">Current focus: Kubernetes fundamentals & Phi architecture.</div>

